{"seq":1,"slug":"general-chemistry","title":"普通化学基础","stage":"DONE","category":"chemistry","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry","rating":{"composite":3.71,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.2,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.15,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"普通化学基础\">普通化学基础</h1><p>普通化学（General Chemistry）是自然科学的核心基础学科之一，研究物质的组成、结构、性质及其变化规律。它为材料科学、生命科学、环境科学、工程技术等众多领域提供理论支撑。掌握普通化学的基本概念和原理，是理解宏观世界与微观世界之间联系的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"定位与目标读者\">定位与目标读者</h2><p>本 Hub 面向具有高中化学基础的成人自学者。内容假设读者了解基本的原子概念、化学方程式书写和摩尔计算，在此基础上深入探讨量子力学视角下的原子模型、分子轨道理论、热力学与动力学分析框架，以及物态变化的定量描述。学习完成后，读者将具备阅读大学化学教材和专业文献的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>高中化学基础（原子结构、化学键、化学方程式）</li>\n<li>摩尔概念与基本化学计量</li>\n<li>初等数学（代数、对数、基础三角函数）</li>\n<li>基本物理学概念（能量、力、电磁波）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"内容结构\">内容结构</h2><p>本知识库从原子结构出发，系统介绍化学键与分子结构、化学反应原理以及物质状态与相变等核心主题。内容编排遵循从微观到宏观、从结构到性质的认知逻辑，力求在数学严谨性与直觉理解之间取得平衡。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>原子结构</strong>从量子力学视角重新审视原子模型，建立电子排布与元素周期律的深层联系。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>化学键与分子结构</strong>探讨共价键、离子键和金属键的本质，引入分子轨道理论与杂化轨道概念。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>化学反应原理</strong>涵盖热力学基础、化学平衡与反应动力学。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>物质状态与相变</strong>讨论气态、液态、固态物质的性质及相变规律。</p>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[原子结构] --&gt; B[化学键与分子结构]&#10;    B --&gt; C[化学反应原理]&#10;    C --&gt; D[物质状态与相变]\">flowchart LR\n    A[原子结构] --&gt; B[化学键与分子结构]\n    B --&gt; C[化学反应原理]\n    C --&gt; D[物质状态与相变]</pre><p>每个章节既独立成篇，又通过内在联系构成完整的知识体系。建议按顺序学习，从微观粒子层面逐步过渡到宏观物质行为。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"atomic-structure","title":"原子结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/atomic-structure","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"quantum-model-atom","title":"量子原子模型（Quantum Model of the Atom）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/atomic-structure/quantum-model-atom"},{"seq":2,"slug":"electron-configuration","title":"电子构型与周期律（Electron Configuration and Periodic Law）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/atomic-structure/electron-configuration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"periodic-trends","title":"元素周期趋势（Periodic Trends）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/atomic-structure/periodic-trends"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"chemical-bonding","title":"化学键与分子结构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-bonding","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ionic-covalent-bonds","title":"离子键与共价键（Ionic and Covalent Bonds）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-bonding/ionic-covalent-bonds"},{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-geometry","title":"分子几何与 VSEPR（Molecular Geometry and VSEPR）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-bonding/molecular-geometry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"intermolecular-forces","title":"分子间作用力（Intermolecular Forces）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-bonding/intermolecular-forces"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"chemical-reactions","title":"化学反应原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-reactions","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"stoichiometry-equilibrium","title":"化学计量与平衡（Stoichiometry and Chemical Equilibrium）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-reactions/stoichiometry-equilibrium"},{"seq":2,"slug":"acid-base-chemistry","title":"酸碱化学（Acid-Base Chemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-reactions/acid-base-chemistry"},{"seq":3,"slug":"redox-electrochemistry","title":"氧化还原与电化学（Redox and Electrochemistry）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/chemical-reactions/redox-electrochemistry"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"states-of-matter","title":"物质状态与相变","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/states-of-matter","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gas-laws-kinetics","title":"气体定律与分子运动论（Gas Laws and Kinetic Molecular Theory）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/states-of-matter/gas-laws-kinetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"solutions-colligative","title":"溶液与依数性（Solutions and Colligative Properties）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/states-of-matter/solutions-colligative"},{"seq":3,"slug":"phase-transitions","title":"相变与相图（Phase Transitions and Phase Diagrams）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/general-chemistry/states-of-matter/phase-transitions"}]}]}